   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 6.72,
   "end": 8.85,
   "text": "That's custody, with your consent.",
   "hl": [
    "custody,",
    "consent."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 8.85,
   "end": 11.5,
   "text": "But in 2012, the Madras High Court",
