    "like",
    "a",
    "ransom."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 14.45,
   "end": 17.15,
   "text": "Money owed? The employer can sue.",
   "hl": [
    "can",
    "sue."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 17.15,
   "end": 21.05,
   "text": "The court told police to register a breach of trust case.",
